### Benchmarks ###
# The k6 summaries are committed — they are the evidence behind the numbers in the
# README. The application logs each run produces are not: one of them is 3 MB of
# stack traces from deliberately racing the old code.
benchmarks/results/*.app.log

# NOTE: src/main/resources/application.yml is intentionally NOT ignored.
# It holds no secrets — every credential is a ${ENV_VAR} placeholder resolved
# from .env (gitignored) or from real env vars in Docker. The app cannot start
# without it, so a clone must include it.

